DTSTART:20260818T115900Z
DTEND:20260818T125900Z
SUMMARY:[Data Mining & Data Science][Machine Learning] WSDM 2027 - Abstract
  submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: ACM International Conference on Web Search an
 d Data Mining\nWebsite: https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/\nSource URL
 : https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nLocation: Hong Kong\, C
 hina\nTopics: Data Mining & Data Science\, Machine Learning\, Fairness & 
 Responsible AI\, Human-AI Interaction & Deployment\nSize: L\nSubmission t
 ype: Paper-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-28\nN
 otes: Official WSDM 2027 pages list Hong Kong (Cordis)\, Feb 15-19\, and 
 AoE deadlines: full-paper abstract Aug 17 and paper Aug 24\, 2026 (closed
 \; notification Nov 2)\, short papers (up to 4 pages\, new work) Nov 17\,
  and doctoral consortium (single-author student packet) Nov 12\, 2026. De
 mo papers closed Oct 15\, 2026.\nScope: Web search\, ranking\, recommenda
 tion and mining of web and social data. Characteristic extensions include
  large-scale graph analysis\, conversational retrieval\, foundation-model
  and agentic web systems\, and fairness and privacy in information access
 . The broad emerging-applications inventory is not treated as evidence th
 at WSDM is a specialist healthcare or climate venue.\nAdditional topics: 
 Information Retrieval & Search\, Recommender Systems\, Graphs & Graph Lea
 rning\, LLM Agents & Tool Use\, Natural Language Processing & LLMs\nScope
  sources (2027): https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html\nScope la
 st checked: 2026-10-07
URL:https://www.wsdm-conference.org/2027/cffp.html
END:VEVENT
